   "updated": 1763726400000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Decided with the user on 2026-11-22: sync every trial's record and search our own data; a trial needs no judgement to be found; rules and a\ngazetteer read a query, no model per search; AI tags with checked quotes, no AI-written summary yet. Asked how a condition's codes are matched\n(diabetes): CTIS publishes MedDRA codes at mixed levels and none for a fifth of trials, so MeSH (free, with its hierarchy) is the concept layer.",
   "originalText": "Decided with the user on 2026-11-22: sync every trial's record and search our own data; a trial needs no judgement to be found; rules and a\ngazetteer read a query, no model per search; AI tags with checked quotes, no AI-written summary yet. Asked how a condition's codes are matched\n(diabetes): CTIS publishes MedDRA codes at mixed levels and none for a fifth of trials, so MeSH (free, with its hierarchy) is the concept layer.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "adr-notes",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
