   "text": "How to use: copy to docs/adr/ADR-NNN-name.excalidraw · replace the grey text (set it to black) · status chip colour: orange open, yellow proposed, green accepted, grey\nsuperseded · one page: if it doesn't fit, the decision is too big, so split it.",
   "originalText": "How to use: copy to docs/adr/ADR-NNN-name.excalidraw · replace the grey text (set it to black) · status chip colour: orange open, yellow proposed, green accepted, grey\nsuperseded · one page: if it doesn't fit, the decision is too big, so split it.",
